Output assets/demo.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 860
Set Height 300
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Shell zsh
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "export PATH=/tmp:$PATH"
Enter
Sleep 200ms
Ctrl+L
Sleep 300ms
Show

Sleep 400ms
Type "csentry check --spec /tmp/d/openapi.yaml --files '/tmp/d/routes/*.ts'"
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 3s
